---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Manages a project's environments

Usage: env [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    Lists the selected project's environments
  create  Creates a staging or preview environment
  update  Reads the current revision and changes the app's scale
  delete  Deletes an environment other than production
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -h, --help
          Print help
